  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Adding some links to the header/navbar of the home page would be a relatively simple addition to increase visibility and accessibility of both the Canny and the VRChat Ask forums. I threw together this mockup just by copying and pasting the local html from the existing website in like a minute, so this may be a low effort, high reward way to increase community interactions.\nAfter Tupper's recent twitter post about asking for \"magic wand\" fixes for the SDK, some people said that people didn't even know about the Canny for feature requests or bug reports until the whole EAC thing. While yes, you can click on \"help\" on the main vrc website, I imagine most players navigate directly to vrchat.com/home rather than vrchat.com THEN to vrchat.com/home.\nTL;DR: Add links to vrchat.com/home navbar so people know to use the forums and the canny.",
